          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle korbeesa toko sorio dabaani ufi iraa baasani baasa, korbeesa aada namaani qulqulleesani qalani woliini, sagale guyya ch'ufa gubani Waaqaa baasanifi daad'i baasanile baasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
