            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya sadeeso, jiboota koromi kud'ani tokofi, elemiye lama, ammalle elemiye ilmoole hoola kud'ani afuri, ta ganna toko, ta kamu aabo womatu inqamne, baasa. ",
